  "plainTextSummary": "Requires banks, co-operative societies, and post offices to deduct 2% TDS on cash withdrawals exceeding INR 1 Crore in aggregate in a financial year. For non-filers of income tax returns, 2% applies between INR 20 Lakhs and INR 1 Crore, and 5% applies on excess over INR 1 Crore.",
